1509
01:34:13.565 --> 01:34:14.566
Porra!

1510
01:34:14.941 --> 01:34:15.942
Porra.

1511
01:34:16.026 --> 01:34:18.862
Tá legal. Tá legal, então, a Nikki...

1512
